{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 45, :comments ["<b>And the afflicted one in whom the plague is, his garments shall be torn, and his head shall be bare, and he shall cover himself down to his mustache.</b> They said in the Midrash: <b>והצרוע</b> — this is the Temple; <b>אשר בו הנגע</b> — this is idolatry, which defiles like a plague; <b>בגדיו יהיו פרומים</b> — these are the priestly garments; <b>וראשו יהיה פרוע</b> — this is the Shekhinah, which withdrew from there; <b>ועל שפם יעטה</b> — they nullified the Torah; <b>וטמא טמא יקרא</b> — this is the first destruction and the second destruction."], :book :leviticus, :voice :rabbeinu-bahya, :lang :en, :chapter 13, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-30T14:25:14.948122840Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}